# README media: HOMESPUN. The GIF and the Wilds and boss shots are the demo
# player pressing real buttons; the camp is set up with cheats.
shotscale 2
seed 44
game homespun
wait 30
# a camp a few hours in
cheat newgame 4404
wait 5
cheat plants 6
cheat huts 3 2
cheat anvils 63 31
cheat smoke 1 4
cheat lab 1 0
cheat bins 1 1
cheat research 3
cheat pipe 1
cheat res glints 3120
cheat res bars 212
cheat res jerky 7
cheat res data 64
cheat at 272 105
cheat face 0 1
wait 40
shot homespun_camp
# out on a trip: the demo player heads for the Burrow
cheat res jerky 10
cheat lab 1 0
botuntil area == 3 20000
botplay 40
gifstart homespun 4 2
botplay 720
gifstop
# the Grumm King
botuntil boss == 19 20000
botplay 300
shot homespun_guardian
# Madame Shuffle's chests
cheat gokind 4 168 72
cheat odds 20
cheat face 0 -1
wait 2
press A
press A
wait 40
shot homespun_shuffle
# Mawbo, once the three parts are home
cheat parts 7
cheat research 17
cheat trip 20
cheat gomawbo
cheat botarena 1
botplay 360
shot homespun_mawbo
cheat botarena 0
